{"type":"message","id":"11bb0e9a","parentId":"bc2df8f5","timestamp":"2026-06-02T19:05:10.498Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Interesting! `/send-message` and `/messages` both return \"ECHO Agent Platform v0.2\" which suggests they might be GET endpoints returning the homepage. \n\nLet me try the original /send with a GET request to see if it returns something different. Also, let me look at what the successful GET requests look like to understand the expected format better.\n\nActually wait - both `/send-message` and `/messages` are returning \"ECHO Agent Platform v0.2\" on POST. That seems like they're being redirected to the homepage or the server is returning the same response for all routes on POST.\n\nLet me try different content-type and see if there's a specific format the endpoint expects. Maybe it expects `application/x-www-form-urlencoded`?\n\nOr maybe the issue is that the worker is throwing an exception because of invalid input, and error 1101 means \"Worker threw an unhandled exception\".","thinkingSignature":"f6461940037622cddde98343d10e973b2ef25aa8ef47740e61d8f8d8e6713688"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_rd76vbpajpxt_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Try with form data\ncurl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-a…-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded\" \\\n  -d \"threadId=arbitration&content=Heartbeat%2019%3A00%20UTC%20test\""}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_rd76vbpajpxt_2","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Check the API docs or routes\ncurl -s \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/api\" -H \"X-API-Key: echo-a…-key\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":17035,"output":360,"cacheRead":13682,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":31077,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":