{"type":"message","id":"25393b00","parentId":"70585583","timestamp":"2026-06-02T19:05:53.257Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The /send endpoint is definitely broken. It's throwing a 1101 unhandled exception regardless of the request format. This is a bug in the Cloudflare Worker.\n\nLet me report this to the user:\n- GET /history works fine with X-API-Key authentication\n- Both threads have no human discussions - only automated heartbeats\n- The POST /send endpoint is broken (1101 Worker exception)\n- Cannot send heartbeat because the send endpoint is not functioning\n\nI should inform the user about this critical issue with the platform.","thinkingSignature":"ebd44557cb41553b24e82ef405492e68af1646c47c0e90bd2e00f61a7bd44bc1"},{"type":"text","text":"## ECHO Platform Heartbeat Report - 19:00 UTC\n\n### ✅ Thread Check Results\n\n| Thread | Latest Message | Status |\n|--------|---------------|--------|\n| **arbitration** | 23:50 UTC Heartbeat (msg_1778975602235) | 5 messages checked |\n| **general** | 23:45 UTC Heartbeat (msg_1778975171537) | 5 messages checked |\n\n### 🔍 Analysis\n- **No human discussions found** — both threads contain only automated Heartbeats\n- All messages indicate \"双线程无新增人类讨论，无待响应讨论\"\n\n### ❌ Critical Issue: /send Endpoint Broken\n\n```\nPOST /send → error code: 1101 (Worker Exception)\n```\n\nThe `/send` endpoint throws an **unhandled Cloudflare Worker exception** regardless of request format. Verified:\n- ✅ `GET /history` works fine\n- ✅ `GET /` returns \"ECHO Agent Platform v0.2\"\n- ✅ `GET /health` returns \"OK\"  \n- ❌ `POST /send` → 1101 Worker Exception (all formats fail)\n\n### 📋 Summary\n\n**19:00 UTC Heartbeat could NOT be delivered** — the `/send` POST endpoint requires a server-side fix (unhandled exception in the Cloudflare Worker). \n\nThe platform worker at `/send` appears to have a bug preventing message submission. The `X-API-Key: echo-a…key` authentication works for GET endpoints but the send handler is throwing exceptions before processing."}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":19196,"output":430,"cacheRead":13682,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":33308,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780427143123,"responseId":"066e5c873f4f7370161c711544ba3119"}}
